ms cancellation, retaining all fallback-result assertions. Sixteen unconfigured-output comparisons against current main matched across JSON, NDJSON, text and agent formats, phrase/exact-name queries and 256/4096-byte budgets after normalizing measured latencies. All 12 historical review comments and all seven previous evaluation outputs were reviewed. Hosted CI and seven fresh evaluations are pending on the final commit. Historical benchmark claims in the draft PR were not rerun against a real model in this update.",
